!!! Two books must not both add the same method to the same type. The symbol
!!! is keyed by the type being extended, not by the extending book, so both
!!! emit one label; left undetected the only report is NIL validation's
!!! "Duplicate NIL label", which names neither book nor a remedy.
!!!
!!! This is the collision imported packages produce in practice: five
!!! packages, each shipping its own slightly different 'do-something'.
!!!
!!! Both extensions live on this page so the fixture is self-contained; the
!!! check fires on the book identity, and a page is one book.
book pkg.first

number begin extension
    do-something returns number begin paragraph
        give my plus 1
    end paragraph
end extension

main returns number begin paragraph
    value n as number is 5
    say n.do-something with nothing
    give 0
end paragraph
